{"title":"2025 IOQM/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span id=\"Problem_Statement_.E0.B4.AA.E0.B5.8D.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.B6.E0.B5.8D.E0.B4.A8.E0.B4.B5.E0.B4.BF.E0.B4.B5.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.A3.E0.B4.82\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_Statement_പ്രശ്നവിവരണം\">Problem Statement പ്രശ്നവിവരണം</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_IOQM/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem Statement പ്രശ്നവിവരണം\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are \\(m,n \\in \\mathbb{R}\\) and a positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/6/396621e5044fb8c047e2799f8556c2b94a956fb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+1)n^2, m^2, a(n+1)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"188\" height=\"21\" /> consist of three consecutive integers when written in increasing order. What is the largest possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/5/0f521656db779d024e6aff0f9a3771ac28d2c3db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m^2$\" width=\"22\" height=\"15\" />?\n</p><p>\\(m,n \\in \\mathbb{R}\\) ആയ മൂന്ന് സംഖ്യകളും ഒരു positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />-യും ഉണ്ട്. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/6/396621e5044fb8c047e2799f8556c2b94a956fb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+1)n^2, m^2, a(n+1)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"188\" height=\"21\" /> എന്നിവയെ increasing order-ൽ എഴുതുമ്പോൾ മൂന്ന് consecutive integers ആയി ലഭിക്കുന്നു. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/5/0f521656db779d024e6aff0f9a3771ac28d2c3db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m^2$\" width=\"22\" height=\"15\" />-ന്റെ സാധ്യമായ ഏറ്റവും വലിയ മൂല്യം എന്താണ്?\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_.E0.B4.AA.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.BF.E0.B4.B9.E0.B4.BE.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.82\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_പരിഹാരം\">Solution പരിഹാരം</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_IOQM/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution പരിഹാരം\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/a/d6a17879fee47bcd6fc51c67aaf2fd44685936d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K=(a+1)n^2, K+1 = m^2, K+2 = a(n+1)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"374\" height=\"21\" />. Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/b/b3ba08fabcaec98b27fef5862b72a33a963169a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+1)n^2 + 2 = a(n+1)^2 \\implies n^2+2-a-2an = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"420\" height=\"21\" />. Hence, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/3/263c04ae769ccfcffae67686d5d9debff7f762e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2 - 2an - (a-2) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"183\" height=\"21\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/c/12c069708c7b7f37379f6fbfa2b72482278fe09f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\in \\mathbb{Z}^+$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"57\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/0/eb0d63cebe4a027ca6e253a5b4c154ba2ad94914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K \\in \\mathbb{Z}^+$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"64\" height=\"18\" /> it follows <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/1/5c155ff59f7f768ee227c2922799f82e433fc051.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\in \\mathbb{Z}^+$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"58\" height=\"18\" /> and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/3/263c04ae769ccfcffae67686d5d9debff7f762e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2 - 2an - (a-2) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"183\" height=\"21\" /> must have integer roots. By the discriminant, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/3/2631d9564291fedb4f10d17e2deaa71177543ffe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4a^2 + 4(a-2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"114\" height=\"21\" /> is a perfect square, thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/666d29b14fd863a7152d27183b3191109fa8fac8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 + a-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"82\" height=\"18\" /> is a perfect square. Thus, rewrite <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/4/ed47ef35959c171399e8f18eed4b517223823c04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=a$\" width=\"44\" height=\"8\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/c/f3c0b6f65448bf7ee204eed0b4d6521fe906d114.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 + x-2 = y^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"125\" height=\"20\" /> for an integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and completing the square we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/2/f327fa464f18805e4872b3c051235b9284b878b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+\\frac{1}{2})^2= y^2 + 2 + \\frac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"177\" height=\"38\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/9/cc99c7aec63612397bca06139cb4d91016d5f4bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2x+1)^2  = 4y^2 +9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"156\" height=\"21\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/9/5492d69ce0a7246721e192768458be663aa5edc9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2x+1)^2- 4y^2 = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"156\" height=\"21\" />, and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/3/3d3f266480417cad32468057a8342249e6f1a329.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2x+1-2y)(2x+1+2y) = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"247\" height=\"20\" />. Thus, the possible <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/3/e53b1fe25be1c679117fb44a6a886fe1247d189a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"44\" height=\"20\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/f/e5fcaf1ac7cd594a5a627e19f7f61ef2772897b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=a \\in \\mathbb{Z}^+$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"91\" height=\"18\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/6/5f6a81ea823fa68d2366934091d84cf6d4962f15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2,2),(2,-2), (1,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"153\" height=\"20\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/a/55afdab16c8c49089c4d9ceeb8d3c8cf1f088be6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> we have that the discriminant is 16 so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/d/b6df56b30dad70347ace19476dcc5dca8eacd6d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = \\frac{8}{2} = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"83\" height=\"38\" /> and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/e/c8ef79652c4b87a4e07c380f9bafc58111a821a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m^2 = (a+1)n^2 + 1 = 3 \\cdot 16 + 1 = \\boxed{49}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"304\" height=\"25\" />. We can neglect <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/2/502e059d1a020b368aee3a99c5669d88331d321f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> through either checking or realizing that this value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> yields a smaller discriminant which implies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is smaller and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/5/0f521656db779d024e6aff0f9a3771ac28d2c3db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m^2$\" width=\"22\" height=\"15\" /> is not maximal.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/a/d6a17879fee47bcd6fc51c67aaf2fd44685936d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K=(a+1)n^2, K+1 = m^2, K+2 = a(n+1)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"374\" height=\"21\" /> എന്ന് എടുക്കുക. അപ്പോൾ, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/b/b3ba08fabcaec98b27fef5862b72a33a963169a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+1)n^2 + 2 = a(n+1)^2 \\implies n^2+2-a-2an = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"420\" height=\"21\" />. അതിനാൽ, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/3/263c04ae769ccfcffae67686d5d9debff7f762e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2 - 2an - (a-2) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"183\" height=\"21\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/c/12c069708c7b7f37379f6fbfa2b72482278fe09f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\in \\mathbb{Z}^+$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"57\" height=\"18\" /> ഉം <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/0/eb0d63cebe4a027ca6e253a5b4c154ba2ad94914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K \\in \\mathbb{Z}^+$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"64\" height=\"18\" /> ഉം ആയതിനാൽ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/1/5c155ff59f7f768ee227c2922799f82e433fc051.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\in \\mathbb{Z}^+$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"58\" height=\"18\" /> ആണെന്ന് ലഭിക്കുന്നു. അതിനാൽ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/3/263c04ae769ccfcffae67686d5d9debff7f762e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2 - 2an - (a-2) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"183\" height=\"21\" />-ന് integer roots ഉണ്ടായിരിക്കണം. Discriminant ഉപയോഗിച്ച്, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/3/2631d9564291fedb4f10d17e2deaa71177543ffe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4a^2 + 4(a-2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"114\" height=\"21\" /> ഒരു perfect square ആയിരിക്കണം, അതിനാൽ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/666d29b14fd863a7152d27183b3191109fa8fac8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 + a-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"82\" height=\"18\" /> ഒരു perfect square ആണ്. അതിനാൽ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/4/ed47ef35959c171399e8f18eed4b517223823c04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=a$\" width=\"44\" height=\"8\" /> എന്ന് rewrite ചെയ്താൽ, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/c/f3c0b6f65448bf7ee204eed0b4d6521fe906d114.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 + x-2 = y^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"125\" height=\"20\" /> എന്നത് ഒരു integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-ക്കായി ലഭിക്കുന്നു. Completing the square ചെയ്താൽ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/2/f327fa464f18805e4872b3c051235b9284b878b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+\\frac{1}{2})^2= y^2 + 2 + \\frac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"177\" height=\"38\" />. അതിനാൽ, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/9/cc99c7aec63612397bca06139cb4d91016d5f4bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2x+1)^2 = 4y^2 +9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"156\" height=\"21\" />, അതായത് <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/9/5492d69ce0a7246721e192768458be663aa5edc9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2x+1)^2- 4y^2 = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"156\" height=\"21\" />, അതിനാൽ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/3/3d3f266480417cad32468057a8342249e6f1a329.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2x+1-2y)(2x+1+2y) = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"247\" height=\"20\" />. അതിനാൽ, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/f/e5fcaf1ac7cd594a5a627e19f7f61ef2772897b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=a \\in \\mathbb{Z}^+$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"91\" height=\"18\" /> ആയിരിക്കുമ്പോഴുള്ള സാധ്യമായ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/3/e53b1fe25be1c679117fb44a6a886fe1247d189a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"44\" height=\"20\" />-കൾ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/6/5f6a81ea823fa68d2366934091d84cf6d4962f15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2,2),(2,-2), (1,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"153\" height=\"20\" /> ആണ്. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/a/55afdab16c8c49089c4d9ceeb8d3c8cf1f088be6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> ആണെങ്കിൽ discriminant 16 ആയതിനാൽ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/d/b6df56b30dad70347ace19476dcc5dca8eacd6d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = \\frac{8}{2} = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"83\" height=\"38\" /> എന്നും അതിനാൽ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/e/c8ef79652c4b87a4e07c380f9bafc58111a821a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m^2 = (a+1)n^2 + 1 = 3 \\cdot 16 + 1 = \\boxed{49}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"304\" height=\"25\" /> എന്നും ലഭിക്കുന്നു. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/2/502e059d1a020b368aee3a99c5669d88331d321f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> പരിശോധിക്കുന്നതിലൂടെയോ, ഈ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> മൂല്യം ഒരു ചെറിയ discriminant നൽകുന്നു, അത് <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> ചെറുതാണെന്നും അതിനാൽ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/5/0f521656db779d024e6aff0f9a3771ac28d2c3db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m^2$\" width=\"22\" height=\"15\" /> maximal അല്ലെന്നും മനസ്സിലാക്കുന്നതിലൂടെയോ നമുക്ക് അത് ഒഴിവാക്കാം.\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018070546\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.026 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 191/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 10659/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37916:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018070546 and revision id 292684. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}